<title>UK: UK business failures down in August - Touche.</title>
<headline>UK business failures down in August - Touche.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK accountants Deloitte &amp; Touche released the following data on administrative receiverships and administration order appointments in Britain in August -</p>
